        <main class="concept-main">
            <section class="concept-story" aria-labelledby="concept-title"><div class="concept-copy"><p class="concept-kicker">A MORE THOUGHTFUL WAY FORWARD</p><h1 id="concept-title">A calmer way<br />to think <em>bigger.</em></h1><p class="concept-description">Step into a more thoughtful way to ask, explore and create with AskPearls.</p></div><div class="concept-art portal-scene" role="img" aria-label="A glowing garden doorway opens onto a calm mountain landscape"><div class="portal-sky"></div><div class="portal-hills"></div><div class="portal-view"></div><div class="portal-ring"></div><div class="portal-sun"></div><div class="portal-steps"></div><span class="portal-spark ps1">✦</span><span class="portal-spark ps2">✧</span><span class="portal-spark ps3">✦</span><p class="portal-caption">A calmer space for brighter ideas and thoughtful choices.</p></div></section>
